  0001-do-not-load-binary-modules-for-dkms-package.patch
  https://github.com/koverstreet/bcachefs-tools/commit/c6fa96409925203569f1ec5f95ac1544fa691548.patch
  https://github.com/koverstreet/bcachefs-tools/commit/82033542e7bf14e4fbaad6a525bf6763f9d9f840.patch
  https://github.com/koverstreet/bcachefs-tools/commit/eeec50f6896c7d52f5fc22c7a3699cbd783a767c.patch
)
